---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="l0llm — Pure C# & Intel Level Zero LLM Runner and Server | HF Laboratories"
  description="Ultra-fast, zero-allocation native LLM runner and OpenAI-compatible REST server designed specifically for Intel® GPUs via Intel oneAPI Level Zero."
  activeTab="products"
>
  <div class="product-page">
    <div class="hero-section">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="status-badge release-badge">RELEASED v2.0.0</span>
        <span class="status-badge">100% PURE C#</span>
        <span class="status-badge">INTEL LEVEL ZERO</span>
        <span class="status-badge">ZERO ALLOCATIONS</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        l0llm
        <span class="hero-sub">Pure C# & Intel Level Zero LLM Runner & REST Server</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-lead">
        Ultra-fast, zero-allocation native LLM runner and OpenAI-compatible REST server engineered exclusively for Intel® GPUs. Built entirely in managed C# on top of LevelZero.NET with <strong>zero Python runtime, zero Conda environments, and zero heavyweight native frameworks</strong>.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-cta-group">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/hf-laboratories/l0llm/releases/download/v2.0.0/l0llm-win-x64-v2.0.0.zip"
          class="btn-primary"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="margin-right:8px;"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
          Download l0llm v2.0.0 (win-x64)
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/hf-laboratories/l0llm/releases/tag/v2.0.0"
          class="btn-secondary"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          GitHub Releases
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/hf-laboratories/l0llm"
          class="btn-secondary"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Source Repository
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Benchmarks Section -->
    <section class="benchmark-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Performance Benchmarks</span>
        <h2>Intel Iris® Xe Mobile Performance (15W TDP)</h2>
        <p>Measured on Intel® Iris® Xe Graphics (96 EU, 15W TDP mobile) running Qwen 2.5 with direct Level Zero command lists.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="metrics-grid">
        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-val text-cyan">41.3 <span class="metric-unit">tok/s</span></div>
          <div class="metric-label">Decode Throughput</div>
          <p class="metric-sub">Fast sustained generation on lightweight mobile integrated GPUs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-val text-blue">18.7 <span class="metric-unit">ms</span></div>
          <div class="metric-label">Prefill Latency</div>
          <p class="metric-sub">Immediate first-token responsiveness with minimal queue lag.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-val text-green">0 <span class="metric-unit">Bytes</span></div>
          <div class="metric-label">GC Allocation per Token</div>
          <p class="metric-sub">Zero Garbage Collection pressure during continuous token generation loops.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="metric-card">
          <div class="metric-val text-purple">11 <span class="metric-unit">Architectures</span></div>
          <div class="metric-label">Intel Hardware Targets</div>
          <p class="metric-sub">Iris Xe, Arc A-Series, Lunar Lake, Arrow Lake, Battlemage, Flex/Max.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Key Architecture Features -->
    <section class="features-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Architectural Highlights</span>
        <h2>Zero-Friction Local & Server-Side LLM Deployment</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feat-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Pure Managed C# Pipeline</h3>
          <p>Direct C# bindings directly to Level Zero driver exports. No PyTorch, no ONNX Runtime C++ dependencies, and no bloated runtime installs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feat-icon">🌐</div>
          <h3>OpenAI-Compatible REST API</h3>
          <p>Drop-in local server supporting /v1/chat/completions with Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming, /v1/models, and built-in CORS for Open-WebUI, Chatbox, and LangChain.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feat-icon">📦</div>
          <h3>Native SafeTensors Support</h3>
          <p>Reads standard Hugging Face model.safetensors and sharded indexes (model.safetensors.index.json) with zero-copy memory mapping.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feat-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>Wide Model Family Support</h3>
          <p>Out-of-the-box optimized execution for LLaMA 3/3.1/3.2, Qwen 2.5/3, DeepSeek, Mistral, and Phi-3.5 architectures.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CLI & Usage -->
    <section class="usage-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">CLI Commands</span>
        <h2>Interactive CLI & REST Server</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="code-container">
        <div class="code-header">
          <span>Start OpenAI-Compatible REST Server</span>
          <span class="code-lang">bash</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code># Start high-performance OpenAI server on Intel GPU
l0llm serve --model ./models/qwen2.5-7b --port 8080 --host 0.0.0.0

# Interactive single-turn or streaming prompt
l0llm run --model ./models/llama3.2-3b --prompt "Explain quantum computing in three sentences"</code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Distribution Assets -->
    <section class="assets-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Release Assets</span>
        <h2>Downloads & Verification</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="assets-table-wrap">
        <table class="assets-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Asset</th>
              <th>Target Platform</th>
              <th>Version</th>
              <th>Action</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>l0llm-win-x64-v2.0.0.zip</strong></td>
              <td>Windows x64 (Intel GPUs)</td>
              <td>v2.0.0</td>
              <td>
                <a href="https://github.com/hf-laboratories/l0llm/releases/download/v2.0.0/l0llm-win-x64-v2.0.0.zip" class="table-dl-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  Download
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .product-page {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px 80px;
  }
  .hero-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 0 60px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .badge-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .status-badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: #94a3b8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
  .status-badge.release-badge {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    color: #34d399;
    border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3);
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: 44px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #38bdf8;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
  }
  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background: #0284c7;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #0369a1;
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #f8fafc;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .section-tag {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #38bdf8;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: block;
  }
  .benchmark-section, .features-section, .usage-section, .assets-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .metrics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .metric-card {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .metric-val {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-family: monospace;
  }
  .metric-unit {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }
  .text-cyan { color: #06b6d4; }
  .text-blue { color: #38bdf8; }
  .text-green { color: #10b981; }
  .text-purple { color: #a855f7; }
  .metric-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .metric-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .feature-box {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .feat-icon {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .feature-box h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }
  .feature-box p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }
  .code-container {
    background: #090d16;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .code-header {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: monospace;
    color: #94a3b8;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  code {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #38bdf8;
  }
  .assets-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .assets-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .assets-table th, .assets-table td {
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .assets-table th {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .table-dl-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #0284c7;
    color: white;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .table-dl-btn:hover {
    background: #0369a1;
  }
</style>
